{"title":"A Painter Who Draws Dungeons","synopsis":"Di dunia yang selamanya berubah akibat Bencana Besar yang membentuk kembali seluruh dunia...\n\nSeo Jio, seorang guru seni biasa, meninggal dalam kebakaran mendadak, hanya untuk terbangun terperangkap di dalam sebuah potret sebagai lukisan itu sendiri.\n\nDi dalam dunia potret tersebut, Jio memperoleh kemampuan mahakuasa. Ia dapat menciptakan kehidupan dan bahkan membuka gerbang ke dimensi lain.\n\nSaat ia menjelajahi dimensi yang tak terhitung jumlahnya, Jio bertemu dengan orang-orang yang terikat oleh takdir dan menggunakan kemampuan barunya untuk membantu mereka mengatasi cobaan yang ada di hadapan mereka.\n\nNamun, dengan setiap dimensi yang ia lewati dan setiap insiden yang ia selesaikan, ia semakin dekat untuk mengungkap kebenaran yang menyelimuti kematiannya sendiri…","alternative_title":"던전을 그리는 화가","author":"Osot","artist":"Geulli","genres":["Action","Fantasy","Mystery"],"chapters":[{"id":"kc_ch_a-painter-who-draws-dungeons_19","number":"19","title":"Chapter 19","date":"2026-08-09","images":[]},{"id":"kc_ch_a-painter-who-draws-dungeons_18","number":"18","title":"Chapter 18","date":"2026-08-02","images":[]},{"id":"kc_ch_a-painter-who-draws-dungeons_17","number":"17","title":"Chapter 17","date":"2026-07-26","images":[]},{"id":"kc_ch_a-painter-who-draws-dungeons_16","number":"16","title":"Chapter 16","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"kc_ch_a-painter-who-draws-dungeons_15","number":"15","title":"Chapter 15","date":"2026-07-12","images":[]},{"id":"kc_ch_a-painter-who-draws-dungeons_14","number":"14","title":"Chapter 14","date":"2026-07-12","images":[]},{"id":"kc_ch_a-painter-who-draws-dungeons_13","number":"13","title":"Chapter 13","date":"2026-07-12","images":[]},{"id":"kc_ch_a-painter-who-draws-dungeons_12","number":"12","title":"Chapter 12","date":"2026-07-12","images":[]},{"id":"kc_ch_a-painter-who-draws-dungeons_11","number":"11","title":"Chapter 11","date":"2026-07-12","images":[]},{"id":"kc_ch_a-pa